[ W       0 ].
```

Exact sparse elimination gives rank 29,515 at all six roots. Consequently the
selected 6,022-square coupling has rank 4,748 and nullity 1,274 at every root.
The kernel compiler emits all 1,274 normalized triangular relations and
reconstructs their complete bordered residual before accepting them.

The selected 4,748 coordinates and dependent 1,274 coordinates are identical
to the partition found independently by G3DI modulo 21,817. Interpolation over
